		"name": "Tutorial_2D",
		"description": "Local and global transformations reveal the hierarchy of reference frames. By contrasting transformations applied relative to an object versus the world, the map exposes how context governs spatial behavior. The player experiences how the same operation yields different outcomes depending on its frame of application. This scene foregrounds the layered structure of coordinate systems and the importance of relational context in computation.",
